WEBVTT

00:00:17.142 --> 00:00:18.602
What is that?!

00:00:18.936 --> 00:00:21.855
It's not like I made a conscious decision.

00:00:22.231 --> 00:00:23.815
They are bigger than mine...

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:26.902
Doesn't a middlesex individual's gender
change to correspond with a mate?

00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:30.155
Does that mean
you've found a suitable male mate?

00:00:30.322 --> 00:00:31.740
I'm getting out!

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.283
Yay!

00:00:33.617 --> 00:00:36.078
I have a deck of cards with me.

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:38.789
Let's all play when we're done.

00:00:38.914 --> 00:00:39.748
What?

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:43.460
I won't be playing cards with you,
Nagate, okay?!

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:45.545
Ow! Ow! Hot! Hot!

00:00:46.213 --> 00:00:49.591
I wonder if the colony ship
made it back to Sidonia safely.

00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:51.969
If there's still a Sidonia to return to.

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:54.930
This is Planet Seven's
Second Satellite Base Headquarters.

00:00:55.097 --> 00:00:56.640
Come in, landing ship. Come in.

00:00:57.099 --> 00:01:00.185
<i>This is the landing ship.
<i>It's a paradise down here.</i></i>

00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:03.272
What is it?

00:01:04.856 --> 00:01:06.358
Hey, what's going on?

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:12.698
<i>HQ, this is the landing party,
<i>this is an emergency!</i></i>

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.950
<i>It's the gau... na...</i>

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:20.539
<i>Go forth and conquer!
<i>Let there be light!</i></i>

00:01:24.543 --> 00:01:29.840
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:01:30.632 --> 00:01:36.596
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:01:37.347 --> 00:01:40.767
KNIGHTS OF SIDONIA

00:01:47.649 --> 00:01:50.694
<i>Our only haven is this fortress</i>

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:53.780
<i>Wandering among the stars</i>

00:01:53.864 --> 00:01:57.034
<i>Where we tremble with impatience</i>

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:59.453
<i>Between life and death</i>

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:05.208
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:10.047
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:02:12.257 --> 00:02:18.180
<i>Those of us who have been led
<i>To gather here</i></i>

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:24.895
<i>Carry within ourselves the will to fight</i>

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:28.523
<i>Our lives shine their brightest</i>

00:02:28.607 --> 00:02:31.026
<i>In the defense of love</i>

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:34.988
<i>We boldly enter the fray</i>

00:02:35.072 --> 00:02:39.493
<i>The Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:02:46.917 --> 00:02:49.419
REUNION

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:33.255
I'm looking for the Net Terminal Gene.

00:03:33.964 --> 00:03:37.175
What happens to Killy after this?

00:03:38.468 --> 00:03:40.512
It all depends on our support.

00:03:47.018 --> 00:03:49.271
Please place the construction material
on the side there.

00:03:49.646 --> 00:03:50.731
Affirmative.

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:54.609
Watch it, Tsumugi!

00:03:54.693 --> 00:03:56.027
You almost hit me!

00:03:56.486 --> 00:03:57.571
Don't worry.

00:03:57.738 --> 00:03:59.531
I won't hit anyone.

00:04:03.744 --> 00:04:06.288
A little further back!

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:07.914
Coming through!

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:09.249
Ren!

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:21.720
I'm sorry!

00:04:30.145 --> 00:04:31.605
Tanikaze...

00:04:32.731 --> 00:04:34.858
Gardes can't fly like you can, Tsumugi.

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:37.194
Thankfully, nobody was hurt,

00:04:37.444 --> 00:04:39.571
but you need to be more careful.

00:04:41.364 --> 00:04:42.449
I know.

00:04:43.492 --> 00:04:47.496
Now, stop looking so sad.
Let's go back and lend them a hand.

00:04:48.663 --> 00:04:50.624
But...Tanikaze...

00:04:50.749 --> 00:04:53.460
how could you tell I was sad?

00:04:54.044 --> 00:04:55.587
And you're surprised now, right?

00:04:55.921 --> 00:04:59.341
You didn't know? It's pretty easy
reading your expressions.

00:05:03.595 --> 00:05:05.138
Did you just smile?

00:05:06.473 --> 00:05:08.099
Stop looking at me!

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:11.353
Tsumugi?!

00:05:15.565 --> 00:05:17.943
We finally get to celebrate our move.

00:05:18.026 --> 00:05:20.570
Yeah, we've been pretty busy lately.

00:05:21.112 --> 00:05:23.198
We've got some nice food,

00:05:23.281 --> 00:05:25.909
and I'm gonna make my grandma's
famous stew. I know it'll be great.

00:05:26.326 --> 00:05:28.578
Really? I can't wait.

00:05:31.456 --> 00:05:32.541
We're back!

00:05:32.958 --> 00:05:33.875
Welcome home!

00:05:34.376 --> 00:05:35.669
Hi, Tsumugi.

00:05:36.169 --> 00:05:38.880
Yuhata! They're home!

00:05:39.089 --> 00:05:41.383
What? I need a little more time here.

00:05:41.841 --> 00:05:42.759
What?

00:05:42.926 --> 00:05:44.511
Yuhata's here?

00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:46.846
Oh, wait!

00:05:48.056 --> 00:05:50.267
You can't go upstairs yet.

00:05:50.433 --> 00:05:51.726
Wait down here, please.

00:05:51.977 --> 00:05:54.145
What? But why?

00:05:56.356 --> 00:05:57.566
What are you talking about?

00:05:57.691 --> 00:06:00.527
Oh, wait, Izana! Tanikaze!

00:06:00.694 --> 00:06:03.863
What? Why are all my things out here?

00:06:05.282 --> 00:06:07.117
Well, that's because...

00:06:07.617 --> 00:06:09.160
Tsumugi, it's ready now!

00:06:09.828 --> 00:06:11.705
Pardon me.

00:06:12.205 --> 00:06:13.582
What? Hey, Tsumugi?

00:06:13.873 --> 00:06:15.333
Now, this way.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:16.459
What is it?

00:06:16.585 --> 00:06:18.086
What is this?

00:06:19.504 --> 00:06:22.048
Okay, go ahead. Open your eyes!

00:06:22.173 --> 00:06:24.050
What is going on?

00:06:24.593 --> 00:06:25.802
Ta-da!

00:06:25.927 --> 00:06:27.762
-Yay!
-Whoa!

00:06:28.763 --> 00:06:30.515
What is this?

00:06:30.682 --> 00:06:32.017
It's a kotatsu!

00:06:32.559 --> 00:06:34.394
Ms. Hiyama told us we could take one!

00:06:35.604 --> 00:06:38.148
I know that this is a kotatsu.

00:06:38.231 --> 00:06:39.649
I want to know

00:06:39.774 --> 00:06:43.903
why the only thing in my room
is this kotatsu.

00:06:44.154 --> 00:06:46.656
Because this was the only
Japanese-style room in the house!

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:49.409
You'll need to move into a different room.

00:06:49.492 --> 00:06:52.954
Also, I'm taking the room
next to Tanikaze's.

00:06:53.204 --> 00:06:54.039
What?

00:06:54.122 --> 00:06:56.541
Ever since the
energy conservation efforts began

00:06:56.708 --> 00:06:59.836
due to the accident,
we've been encouraged to live in groups.

00:07:00.295 --> 00:07:03.798
So, I've decided to live here as well.

00:07:03.965 --> 00:07:04.883
What?

00:07:07.093 --> 00:07:08.261
Izana!

00:07:16.227 --> 00:07:17.562
Wow!

00:07:17.687 --> 00:07:19.481
You can peel it with one hand?

00:07:21.983 --> 00:07:23.109
Coming through!

00:07:30.033 --> 00:07:31.284
Coming through!

00:07:32.494 --> 00:07:35.330
Tsumugi! Cut that out!

00:07:35.664 --> 00:07:36.957
Yuhata,

00:07:37.082 --> 00:07:39.084
you're a bit naggy, aren't you?

00:07:44.881 --> 00:07:46.132
Good morning.

00:07:46.549 --> 00:07:47.467
Hi.

00:07:47.717 --> 00:07:50.595
-Have you gotten used to your prosthetic?
-Yes, a little bit.

00:07:50.929 --> 00:07:54.557
Then maybe it's time we tested you out
on the ten finger control stick.

00:08:07.445 --> 00:08:10.198
The human brain is amazing.

00:08:10.407 --> 00:08:14.536
Yes, it almost feels like I've had
ten fingers on this hand my whole life.

00:08:14.828 --> 00:08:18.581
Try connecting your fingers
to the control stick terminal.

00:08:18.748 --> 00:08:19.708
Okay.

00:08:26.673 --> 00:08:30.301
We can deliver the visual information
from the garde directly into the brain.

00:08:30.552 --> 00:08:33.972
If you close your eyes, it should
feel like you've become the garde.

00:08:41.771 --> 00:08:46.026
This will take some more
getting used to.

00:08:46.943 --> 00:08:48.361
I'm home!

00:08:49.946 --> 00:08:52.657
Grandma, you're home.
That's a rare occurrence.

00:08:53.867 --> 00:08:56.286
Wait, what happened to your eye?
And your arm!

00:08:56.578 --> 00:08:59.622
I was hurt during the gravitational
disturbances the other day.

00:08:59.831 --> 00:09:03.793
What? You need to be careful!

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:09.299
I'm fine, it's not very serious.
What are you doing here today?

00:09:10.633 --> 00:09:12.594
I came to get the rest of my clothes.

00:09:12.969 --> 00:09:14.763
How is your new place?

00:09:17.307 --> 00:09:21.102
Well, we just got a new roommate,
so that's fun.

00:09:23.772 --> 00:09:28.318
You've grown into such a woman
while I was gone.

00:09:29.569 --> 00:09:32.739
It's because of Tanikaze, isn't it?

00:09:32.822 --> 00:09:35.325
What?! No!

00:09:36.034 --> 00:09:37.535
Oh, that's right, Izana.

00:09:37.869 --> 00:09:39.370
Come over here.

00:09:42.248 --> 00:09:45.293
Here are some old clothes
I used to wear when I was younger.

00:09:46.169 --> 00:09:48.463
Take anything you like.

00:09:51.591 --> 00:09:55.011
Wow, you had interesting taste, Grandma.

00:09:55.678 --> 00:09:57.180
How about something like this?

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:01.518
Oh, my! You look exactly like I did

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:04.229
when I was younger.

00:10:04.395 --> 00:10:06.898
Oh! Let me get changed,
and we can go out together!

00:10:06.981 --> 00:10:07.816
What?

00:10:07.899 --> 00:10:09.901
No way! Not in anything like this!

00:10:10.026 --> 00:10:11.778
I'd die of embarrassment!

00:10:13.071 --> 00:10:14.739
Oh, of course...

00:10:15.115 --> 00:10:16.282
I'm sorry.

00:10:16.491 --> 00:10:20.578
I got a little too excited
remembering old times.

00:10:23.832 --> 00:10:25.542
Okay, fine...

00:10:26.084 --> 00:10:27.752
but just for a little bit.

00:10:35.218 --> 00:10:38.221
Grandma, can we go home now?

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:40.181
Come on, just a little longer!

00:10:41.057 --> 00:10:44.435
Oh! That place is still around?

00:10:44.561 --> 00:10:46.521
Oh, hey, Grandma!

00:10:47.689 --> 00:10:48.857
Come on...

00:10:50.608 --> 00:10:53.236
Thank you for coming out with me today.

00:10:53.862 --> 00:10:56.990
I haven't done this in a while

00:10:57.157 --> 00:10:59.159
since most of my friends have passed away.

00:10:59.325 --> 00:11:01.953
Yeah, you have lived
a long time, Grandma.

00:11:02.787 --> 00:11:05.874
Well, I'm glad I got to see you
having a good time today.

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:11.588
SCHEDULE
VISIT: SASAKI

00:11:12.547 --> 00:11:13.840
Oh, I'm sorry, Izana.

00:11:14.632 --> 00:11:17.093
I have to go back to work now.

00:11:17.176 --> 00:11:19.512
What? I have to go home by myself?

00:11:19.804 --> 00:11:21.222
I'm sorry!

00:11:23.057 --> 00:11:24.726
Seriously...?

00:11:40.909 --> 00:11:43.077
<i>Please, don't let anyone I know see me.</i>

00:11:46.456 --> 00:11:47.707
Izana?

00:11:50.001 --> 00:11:51.085
What are you doing?

00:11:56.549 --> 00:12:02.430
SITES OF SIDONIA
50TH GRAVITY COSTUME CUP

00:12:04.724 --> 00:12:05.642
Oh...

00:12:05.892 --> 00:12:08.311
My grandma forced me to wear this.

00:12:09.646 --> 00:12:12.482
I told her I didn't want to.

00:12:13.149 --> 00:12:13.983
Oh, okay.

00:12:14.859 --> 00:12:16.903
What are you doing here, Nagate?

00:12:17.195 --> 00:12:19.614
I'm on my way home.

00:12:19.864 --> 00:12:22.283
Oh, okay...

00:12:23.826 --> 00:12:26.245
It's been 100 years
since they first delayed the kit!

00:12:26.412 --> 00:12:29.082
Mark 17 Tsugumori is finally here!

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:33.294
I couldn't stop crying when I first heard
that they were going to re-release them!

00:12:34.295 --> 00:12:37.298
I can't wait to re-create
a Shiratsuki four unit clasp formation!

00:12:38.841 --> 00:12:42.178
Isn't that the pilot Nagate Tanikaze?

00:12:42.303 --> 00:12:43.304
What?

00:12:43.596 --> 00:12:46.891
Oh, that's quite a fancy-looking girl
he's with.

00:12:48.601 --> 00:12:49.936
A girl?!

00:12:51.813 --> 00:12:54.440
It's true! It's Tanikaze!

00:12:54.649 --> 00:12:56.609
And who is that next to him?

00:12:59.654 --> 00:13:00.822
Who is it?!

00:13:04.993 --> 00:13:08.371
Who asks for a meeting
and forgets all about it, Shinatose?

00:13:08.496 --> 00:13:09.831
I'm sorry.

00:13:10.206 --> 00:13:11.749
Why are you dressed like that?

00:13:13.042 --> 00:13:14.127
I just...

00:13:14.585 --> 00:13:18.089
Does it remind you of when we used
to hang out a long time ago?

00:13:19.757 --> 00:13:21.050
And...?

00:13:21.134 --> 00:13:23.678
What did you want to see me about?

00:13:23.803 --> 00:13:25.263
This way.

00:13:25.346 --> 00:13:27.348
There's something I wanted to show you.

00:13:29.142 --> 00:13:30.268
Wait, is this...?

00:13:30.852 --> 00:13:32.353
Is this from that explosion?

00:13:32.687 --> 00:13:35.148
-How could...?!
-I know.

00:13:35.356 --> 00:13:40.528
But the captain ordered us to complete it.

00:13:40.653 --> 00:13:41.988
Shinatose...

00:13:42.405 --> 00:13:43.656
Please, Sasaki...

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:46.284
I need your help.

00:13:50.705 --> 00:13:53.458
Can we take this other way home today?

00:13:53.541 --> 00:13:55.835
What? Okay...

00:14:14.645 --> 00:14:16.939
What are you doing, Nagate?!

00:14:17.065 --> 00:14:18.066
Sorry!

00:14:18.357 --> 00:14:19.692
Go ahead of me!

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:21.235
Okay.

00:14:30.286 --> 00:14:33.498
<i>When did Tanikaze
<i>start seeing women like that?</i></i>

00:14:34.457 --> 00:14:36.751
<i>No. No. But...</i>

00:14:36.918 --> 00:14:38.669
Yuhata!

00:14:39.712 --> 00:14:41.881
You dropped something.

00:14:44.384 --> 00:14:46.552
You broke it.

00:14:49.555 --> 00:14:52.308
Tsumugi!

00:14:55.812 --> 00:14:58.106
Wha... What's wrong?

00:14:58.314 --> 00:14:59.399
Oh...

00:14:59.649 --> 00:15:01.442
It was just you, Izana.

00:15:05.446 --> 00:15:07.615
Are you still mad?

00:15:08.658 --> 00:15:11.411
Tsumugi! You're banned from my room!

00:15:14.288 --> 00:15:16.624
Unit Shinatose, assembly complete.

00:15:16.833 --> 00:15:18.418
I'm finished as well.

00:15:18.918 --> 00:15:21.629
That's all we have scheduled today.

00:15:23.548 --> 00:15:24.799
Good work today.

00:15:24.966 --> 00:15:26.300
You, too!

00:15:27.093 --> 00:15:29.345
Tanikaze.

00:15:29.887 --> 00:15:32.056
Would you like to clasp formation
home together?

00:15:32.348 --> 00:15:33.724
Yeah, sure.

00:15:43.734 --> 00:15:46.821
Those two do the same thing every time.

00:15:49.657 --> 00:15:51.784
<i>Tsumugi, a little slower.</i>

00:15:51.993 --> 00:15:53.453
<i>Okay.</i>

00:15:55.329 --> 00:15:56.622
<i>All garde pilots,</i>

00:15:56.747 --> 00:15:59.250
<i>submit your work reports today.</i>

00:15:59.667 --> 00:16:02.295
Oh, are you done
for the day too, Izana?

00:16:02.462 --> 00:16:03.754
Good work.

00:16:04.338 --> 00:16:06.757
What are you talking about?
I was working with you!

00:16:06.924 --> 00:16:09.635
And just now,
I was flying right behind you!

00:16:09.802 --> 00:16:13.264
Maybe you were too busy
having fun with Tsumugi to notice!

00:16:17.435 --> 00:16:19.604
Why is Izana so mad?

00:16:22.273 --> 00:16:24.525
Shinatose? What is it?

00:16:25.067 --> 00:16:27.028
Oh... nothing.

00:16:29.155 --> 00:16:32.074
<i>This is a message
<i>for Pilot Nagate Tanikaze.</i></i>

00:16:32.283 --> 00:16:36.078
<i>Come to the West 3 Ready Room immediately.</i>

00:16:36.245 --> 00:16:38.039
<i>-You have one minute.
-What?</i>

00:16:41.918 --> 00:16:43.669
You're 20 seconds late.

00:16:43.794 --> 00:16:46.005
I'm so sorry!

00:16:47.798 --> 00:16:49.133
Yure?!

00:16:50.176 --> 00:16:52.512
Important cultural assets investigation...

00:16:52.595 --> 00:16:53.763
I'm supposed to do that?

00:16:54.055 --> 00:16:56.891
Only high-ranking crew members
can enter this district,

00:16:57.058 --> 00:16:58.559
so I wanted to ask you.

00:16:59.101 --> 00:17:00.811
Is this your first mission like this?

00:17:01.479 --> 00:17:04.023
It will be quite difficult.

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:05.983
Are you confident you can do it alone?

00:17:07.485 --> 00:17:08.528
I'm not sure...

00:17:09.278 --> 00:17:10.780
Okay, fine.

00:17:10.988 --> 00:17:12.114
I have an idea.

00:17:12.365 --> 00:17:13.950
I'll give you special permission

00:17:14.158 --> 00:17:17.078
to bring one other person
to help you just this once.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:19.455
I recommend Izana.

00:17:20.206 --> 00:17:22.291
Okay... but what is--

00:17:22.458 --> 00:17:24.001
No talking back!

00:17:24.627 --> 00:17:26.671
The last time I treated your neck,

00:17:26.879 --> 00:17:30.383
I secretly rigged an explosive
inside your body.

00:17:30.466 --> 00:17:33.177
If you do not execute your mission
by the deadline,

00:17:33.344 --> 00:17:34.762
I'll set it off.

00:17:34.887 --> 00:17:35.721
What?!

00:17:36.222 --> 00:17:37.890
Oh, that's right.

00:17:38.015 --> 00:17:40.059
Make sure not to mention me...

00:17:40.351 --> 00:17:41.561
not even to Izana.

00:17:41.936 --> 00:17:44.730
Consider it a mission failure
if anyone finds out.

00:17:44.897 --> 00:17:46.148
Yes, ma'am!

00:17:49.443 --> 00:17:50.403
I'm home.

00:17:50.528 --> 00:17:52.196
-Welcome back!
-Welcome back!

00:17:53.614 --> 00:17:54.949
What's wrong?

00:17:55.157 --> 00:17:56.492
You don't look well.

00:17:56.951 --> 00:18:00.162
Oh... it's nothing.

00:18:00.955 --> 00:18:04.208
-Where's Izana?
-In her room, I think.

00:18:09.505 --> 00:18:10.715
Izana?

00:18:10.881 --> 00:18:13.968
There's something I wanted
to talk to you about. You have a minute?

00:18:17.597 --> 00:18:19.348
-No.
-What?

00:18:19.765 --> 00:18:21.183
It's really important.

00:18:21.392 --> 00:18:22.560
Please.

00:18:26.105 --> 00:18:27.481
What?

00:18:27.898 --> 00:18:29.150
Well...

00:18:29.483 --> 00:18:31.235
can I talk to you inside?

00:18:31.402 --> 00:18:32.528
Why?

00:18:32.737 --> 00:18:34.572
Are you serious?

00:18:35.573 --> 00:18:37.908
A secret mission? What is that?

00:18:38.367 --> 00:18:39.327
Tomorrow,

00:18:39.535 --> 00:18:42.371
we have to investigate
an area called Senshukyou.

00:18:42.538 --> 00:18:43.998
What, Senshukyou?!

00:18:44.415 --> 00:18:45.291
You know it?

00:18:45.416 --> 00:18:46.709
Of course I do!

00:18:46.834 --> 00:18:49.837
It's one of the top sites of Sidonia!

00:18:51.172 --> 00:18:54.425
But I need to report
to Ship Repairs tomorrow.

00:18:54.884 --> 00:18:58.429
Don't worry. You won't need to go tomorrow
or the day after tomorrow either.

00:18:58.721 --> 00:19:01.307
-Not the day after tomorrow?
-That's right.

00:19:01.515 --> 00:19:05.895
Since it was such short notice,
I thought we needed time to find lodging.

00:19:06.312 --> 00:19:09.857
L... Lodging?

00:19:10.107 --> 00:19:14.236
There's no way there's a real mission
in a scenic place like that.

00:19:14.528 --> 00:19:16.989
If you wanted to invite me
on a trip, just say so.

00:19:17.281 --> 00:19:18.407
This isn't a vacation!

00:19:18.908 --> 00:19:21.369
This is very serious! Izana!

00:19:21.577 --> 00:19:23.454
I want you to take this mission with me!

00:19:25.831 --> 00:19:28.209
What's wrong with you, Nagate?

00:19:28.751 --> 00:19:31.545
What do you expect me to say
after you come at me like that?

00:19:33.005 --> 00:19:34.048
Damn it.

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:37.051
I'm sorry.

00:19:37.301 --> 00:19:39.553
I'm really bad at this.

00:19:39.929 --> 00:19:41.722
Of course you don't want to do this.

00:19:41.806 --> 00:19:44.975
Who wants to spend a night
at an old place like that?

00:19:47.061 --> 00:19:48.938
Oh, fine.

00:19:50.356 --> 00:19:51.232
I'll go.

00:19:51.399 --> 00:19:53.818
Really?! Yes!

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:57.321
-Thank you, Izana!
-Hold on, Nagate!

00:20:03.994 --> 00:20:07.748
<i>Tanikaze just asked Izana
<i>to go on an overnight trip with him?</i></i>

00:20:08.124 --> 00:20:10.251
<i>And to Senshukyou?!</i>

00:20:13.045 --> 00:20:14.255
Good morning.

00:20:14.422 --> 00:20:16.716
-Good morning.
-Good morning.

00:20:18.134 --> 00:20:19.009
Oh?

00:20:19.218 --> 00:20:21.470
You two are up early today.

00:20:21.637 --> 00:20:23.013
Is something the matter?

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:25.224
No, nothing's the matter.

00:20:25.391 --> 00:20:26.892
Thank you for the food!

00:20:28.477 --> 00:20:29.979
Bye!

00:20:30.771 --> 00:20:32.148
Bye, have fun!

00:20:32.606 --> 00:20:34.275
Oh, I almost forgot...

00:20:34.567 --> 00:20:37.319
I have plans with my grandma today!

00:20:39.447 --> 00:20:40.740
Bye.

00:20:41.073 --> 00:20:42.491
Bye.

00:20:46.078 --> 00:20:47.663
How shameless.

00:20:47.997 --> 00:20:49.832
Honestly, I'm shocked.

00:20:57.757 --> 00:20:59.175
Looks like...

00:20:59.675 --> 00:21:02.303
we're on schedule.

00:21:09.018 --> 00:21:10.936
Oh, this way.

00:21:23.616 --> 00:21:25.242
Oh, so this is the entrance?

00:21:25.534 --> 00:21:27.161
This is going to be great.

00:21:27.369 --> 00:21:30.456
-We're on a mission, Izana.
-I know.

00:21:31.957 --> 00:21:32.958
All right.

00:21:58.734 --> 00:22:00.528
Wow.

00:22:00.611 --> 00:22:01.821
So this is...

00:22:02.196 --> 00:22:03.781
Senshukyou.

00:22:05.157 --> 00:22:07.034
Over here, Nagate!

00:22:09.870 --> 00:22:13.499
Look, it's even prettier
when you see it up close!

00:22:20.339 --> 00:22:21.549
Nagate?

00:22:30.766 --> 00:22:32.059
Izana...

00:22:33.269 --> 00:22:35.020
Nagate...

00:22:40.818 --> 00:22:42.403
TO BE CONTINUED

00:22:46.824 --> 00:22:50.786
<i>Oh, if this world must decay</i>

00:22:50.869 --> 00:22:54.540
<i>And I'm destined to give my life away</i>

00:22:54.623 --> 00:22:59.712
<i>What should I be living for?</i>

00:23:01.297 --> 00:23:05.634
<i>If I had never met you</i>

00:23:05.718 --> 00:23:09.305
<i>I would never have known</i>

00:23:09.388 --> 00:23:15.311
<i>This pain that tears at my heart</i>

00:23:15.394 --> 00:23:17.730
<i>-To be the sport of fortune
<i>-Echoing there</i></i>

00:23:17.813 --> 00:23:19.815
<i>-Fortune
<i>-In the furthest reaches of the cosmos</i></i>

00:23:19.898 --> 00:23:22.818
<i>-Fortune
<i>-Is this clumsy requiem</i></i>

00:23:22.901 --> 00:23:25.195
<i>-To be the sport of fortune
<i>-And yet</i></i>

00:23:25.279 --> 00:23:27.114
<i>-Fortune
<i>-I'm still searching</i></i>

00:23:27.197 --> 00:23:30.534
<i>-Fortune
<i>-Within this uncertain reality</i></i>

00:23:31.118 --> 00:23:32.620
<i>For you</i>

00:23:32.703 --> 00:23:36.332
<i>The joy of our finding each other</i>

00:23:36.415 --> 00:23:40.044
<i>The vanished warmth</i>

00:23:40.127 --> 00:23:43.756
<i>You should know that I remember it all</i>

00:23:43.839 --> 00:23:47.509
<i>Because I loved you</i>

00:23:47.593 --> 00:23:51.180
<i>The emotions that arise</i>

00:23:51.263 --> 00:23:54.808
<i>The scars left in my heart</i>

00:23:54.892 --> 00:23:59.229
<i>You should know that I'll carry them all</i>

00:23:59.313 --> 00:24:05.903
<i>As I walk this path</i>
